OL,3,GNEWSADolly Parton's gift of reading to
OL,4,A1,000 Manx kids
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 1,000 children on the Isle of
OL,7,FMan have recieved books through Dolly
OL,8,FParton's Imagination Library since the
OL,9,Fscheme launched in Douglas at
OL,10,FChristmas.
OL,12,FIt posts a free book to every
OL,13,Fregistered child each month until they
OL,14,Fturn five, and has since spread across
OL,15,Fmost of the island's parishes.
OL,17,FParton - a country star whose literacy
OL,18,Fcampaigns have brought books to
OL,19,Fmillions of children around the globe -
OL,20,Fdied this week, aged 80.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
