OL,3,GNEWSADolly Parton's gift of reading to
OL,4,A1,000 Manx kids
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Dolly's vision has already had an
OL,7,Fextraordinary impact here on the Isle
OL,8,Fof Man," said Trish McDonough, who has
OL,9,Fbeen coordinating the scheme's roll-out
OL,10,Flocally.
